Terminator Salvation is an interactive adventure based on the spectacular film "Terminator Salvation." Now, every user will have the chance to become the film's protagonist and save all of humanity — no other option is possible.

As a reminder, in this adventure, the conflict between humans and machines is almost over. Robots have taken over the planet and established their own rules, while the Skynet system creates its own laws and controls its own subordinates. Only a small handful of human rebels decide to challenge this system, sparking a rash of rebellions. All thanks to a hero who has come from the past and now intends to do everything to save humanity. However, humans still don't know his main secret, which could dash all hope.

Terminator 4 – a third-person shooter. Expect endless firefights and an engaging cover system that lets you skillfully hide behind any ledge. A superb storyline with engaging and unexpected twists awaits you. Beautiful graphics and much more! It's time to become a hero!

Game features:
- the time has come to personally fight the terrible and merciless machines that imagine themselves to be the rulers of this world;
- don't underestimate your enemy, machines know no mercy, they are ready to go straight ahead and won't hesitate when they get the opportunity to destroy their enemy;
- the ability to use various shelters is the only chance to defeat an enemy that has not only futuristic weapons and constant support, but also excellent armor that will take a long time and effort to penetrate;
If you try downloading Terminator 4 via torrent, you'll discover a world ruled by machines and consider whether it's even worth giving robots any significant power.
